					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							hey guys<br />
I got to figuring it up last night and we have around 3 to 4 groups of 45 plus so we can start going to some higher places as long as everyone shows up for the events.When we planned Kael the other day we should have had plenty of ppl to go--that said they were going to go. BUT when the time came to go not everyone who was going to go was online or wanted to come down from the moon to do it.Its not fair to those that wanted to go if we dont have full participation in events.We have enough folks to do planes raids but its the whole thing it has to be planned in advance and have enough ppl to sign up.I want ppl to start signing up on events like we used to do since I was able to make groups ahead of time and that cut out a lot of wasted time on sitting and figuring out levels/classes.<br />
heres a list of events I want to carry out in the month of January----<br />
1. Tower of Frozen Shadow lvl 7 take out Tserrina<br />
2.Fruity boots raid<br />
3.Hate<br />
4.Fear<br />
5.Karnor's castle<br />
6.City of Mist<br />
7.Kedge Keep<br />
8.and any place we need to get epic items such as Lake of ill omen, Lake Rathe, Emerald Jungle,etc.<br />
9. for some of the lower lvl folks who are still 35 to 40 I havent forgotten about you folks either---<br />
I know Arlenn was wanting to plan a Kaesora raid for you guys which would be good exp and loot. <br />
10.for those that are not over the lvl of 52 we can get together with Dedicated to do Vox and Naggy I just need to know when is best for everyone so I can post it on their site as well.<br />
ok I am through writing my book so be safe=)
